e:sub} announced a 4-3-3 and attacked in a 3-3-4: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 3-5-2. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-4-2-1.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-4 with the ball, 3-6-1 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-2-1 with the ball, 4-4-1-1 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the left wing (26% of touches).","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 47% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the left wing (25% of touches)."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:home:sub} defended higher (back line 46.2 m from goal, against 20.1 m; tournament average: 29.2 m). Defend high and win: the line held, and so did the gamble."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:home:sub} : un PPDA de 9,4, contre 54,3 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte : {T:home:sub} récupère 36 % de ses ballons perdus en moins de 5 s, contre 27 %. Une meute.","19 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Victoire du collectif qui court : {T:home:sub} a gagné le match en le jouant dans le camp adverse."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:home:sub}: a PPDA of 9.4, against 54.3 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Reaction to losing it: {T:home:sub} win back 36% of lost balls within 5 s, against 27%. A pack.","19 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"A win for the team that ran: {T:home:sub} won the game by playing it in the opponent's half."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:away:sub} et ses petits triangles près du ballon (+0,25) ; de l'autre, {T:home:sub} et ses couloirs bien rangés (−0,45).","keys":["Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Aymeric Laporte, impliqué dans 207 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Otar Kakabadze, impliqué dans 32 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football positionniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"On one side, {T:away:sub} and their little triangles near the ball (+0.25); on the other, {T:home:sub} and their tidy lanes (−0.45).","keys":["The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Aymeric Laporte, involved in 207 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Otar Kakabadze, involved in 32 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, positional football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Les transitions ont fait mal à {T:away:sub} : 10 tirs concédés dans les 15 s qui suivent une perte (0,89 xG), contre 3 en face.","keys":["Buts encaissés en transition par {T:away:sub} : 75', 83'. Le repli arrivait en retard.","{T:home:Sub} : 5,3 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 4,5 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 20 % des cas.","{T:away:Sub} : 6,4 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 6,8 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 63 % des cas."],"impact":"Un rappel utile : on ne perd pas un match quand on perd le ballon, mais quand on oublie de revenir."},"en":{"lead":"Transitions hurt {T:away:sub}: 10 shots conceded within 15 s of losing the ball (0.89 xG), against 3 at the other end.","keys":["Goals conceded in transition by {T:away:sub}: 75', 83'. The recovery run came too late.","{T:home:sub}: 5.3 players behind the ball at the loss, 4.5 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 20% of cases.","{T:away:sub}: 6.4 players behind the ball at the loss, 6.8 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 63% of cases."],"impact":"A useful reminder: you do not lose a match when you lose the ball, but when you forget to run back."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Otar Kiteishvili avait un fan-club, et il portait le maillot adverse : 1,40 adversaire par touche de plus que la normale, dans les 10 m.","keys":["Giorgi Kochorashvili ({T:away:bare}) : +1,33.","Zurab Davitashvili ({T:away:bare}) : +1,19.","Giorgi Chakvetadze ({T:away:bare}) : +1,11.","À l'autre bout, Robin Le Normand (−1,34) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"Otar Kiteishvili a aspiré la défense, sans que personne n'en profite : de la gravité sans satellite."},"en":{"lead":"Otar Kiteishvili had a fan club, wearing the other shirt: 1.40 extra opponents per touch within 10 m.","keys":["Giorgi Kochorashvili ({T:away:sub}): +1.33.","Zurab Davitashvili ({T:away:sub}): +1.19.","Giorgi Chakvetadze ({T:away:sub}): +1.11.","At the other end, Robin Le Normand (−1.34) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"Otar Kiteishvili pulled the defence in, but nobody cashed in: gravity without a satellite."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 3,25 pour {T:home:sub}, 0,49 pour {T:away:sub}. Celui qui faisait avancer le ballon vers le danger : Lamine Yamal (0,95 xT, 29 % du total de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée Lamine Yamal à la 51e minute (+0,38 xT).","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une conduite de balle signée Giorgi Kochorashvili à la 30e minute (+0,05 xT)."],"impact":"La menace a payé : {T:home:sub} a fait avancer le ballon plus dangereusement, et le score a suivi."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 3.25 for {T:home:sub}, 0.49 for {T:away:sub}. The man moving the ball towards danger: Lamine Yamal (0.95 xT, 29% of his team's total).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Lamine Yamal in minute 51 (+0.38 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a carry by Giorgi Kochorashvili in minute 30 (+0.05 xT)."],"impact":"Threat paid off: {T:home:sub} moved the ball more dangerously, and the score followed."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, Lamine Yamal pointe au 2e rang des attaquants (sur 49). Ce match, c'était aussi une vitrine.","keys":["Aymeric Laporte ({T:home:bare}) : 6e des latéraux sur 78.","Nico Williams ({T:home:bare}) : 4e des attaquants sur 49.","Rodri ({T:home:bare}) : 9e des milieux sur 82.","Joueurs dans le top 5 de leur poste : 2 pour {T:home:sub}, 0 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"La hiérarchie a été respectée : {T:home:sub} alignait plus de joueurs au sommet de leur poste, et ça s'est vu."},"en":{"lead":"Across the whole competition, Lamine Yamal ranks 2nd among forwards (out of 49). This match was also a showcase.","keys":["Aymeric Laporte ({T:home:sub}): 6th of 78 full-backs.","Nico Williams ({T:home:sub}): 4th of 49 forwards.","Rodri ({T:home:sub}): 9th of 82 midfielders.","Players in their position's top 5: 2 for {T:home:sub}, 0 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The pecking order held: {T:home:sub} fielded more players at the top of their position, and it showed."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Un sosie pour Nico Williams dans les chiffres ? Jérémy Doku ({TN:Belgium}, Euro 2024), avec 93 % de similarité.","keys":["Lamine Yamal ↔ Raphinha (Coupe du monde 2022, 99 %).","Aymeric Laporte ↔ M. Hummels (Euro 2016, 97 %).","Guram Kashia ↔ Kendall Waston (Coupe du monde 2022, 97 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"If Nico Williams had a lookalike in the numbers, it would be Jérémy Doku ({TN:Belgium}, Euro 2024): 93% similar.","keys":["Lamine Yamal ↔ Raphinha (2022 World Cup, 99%).","Aymeric Laporte ↔ M. Hummels (Euro 2016, 97%).","Guram Kashia ↔ Kendall Waston (2022 World Cup, 97%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}